  "title": "New Pacific Reports Financial Results For The Three and Six Months Ended December 31, 2024 - New Pacific Metals Corp.",
  "summary": "Download PDF Version VANCOUVER, BRITISH COLUMBIA – February 6, 2025: New Pacific Metals Corp. (“New Pacific” or the “Company”) reports its financial results for the three and six months ended December 31, 2024. All figures are expressed in US dollars unless otherwise stated. FINANCIAL RESULTS Net loss attributable to equity holders of the Company for the three and six months ended December 31, 2024 was $0.74 million and $2.00 million[…]",
